1
00:00:00,023 --> 00:00:03,973
(Sheldon(on phone):)would be perfect to appear
on our first panel.

2
00:00:04,861 --> 00:00:07,641
Well, now, why are you saying "no"?
You haven't even asked him yet.

3
00:00:08,965 --> 00:00:11,205
(Sheldon(on phone):)You know, excuse me,
but I sat through Iron Man 2.

4
00:00:11,368 --> 00:00:13,708
(Sheldon(on phone):)I believe he owes me
two hours of his time.

5
00:00:15,772 --> 00:00:17,342
(Sheldon(on phone):)They hung up on me.

6
00:00:22,045 --> 00:00:23,885
(Leonard:)Did you tell them that you're
holding your convention at

7
00:00:24,114 --> 00:00:27,184
(Leonard:)a Marie Callender's, and that every
panelist gets a free slice of pie?

8
00:00:28,318 --> 00:00:30,028
(Sheldon:)I didn't even get to that part.

9
00:00:31,188 --> 00:00:33,998
(Leonard:)Look, even your friend Wil Wheaton
thinks this is a waste of time.

10
00:00:34,157 --> 00:00:37,507
(Sheldon:)Not true.
Wil thinks this is a great idea.

11
00:00:37,661 --> 00:00:40,401
(Sheldon:)He was just concerned that
he wasn't a big enough celebrity

12
00:00:40,564 --> 00:00:42,674
(Sheldon:)to headline such an amazing event.

13
00:00:42,833 --> 00:00:45,573
(Sheldon:)Also, that's the same day
that he shampoos his beard.

14
00:00:47,737 --> 00:00:50,577
Sheldon, I just don't think this
is going to come together for you.

15
00:00:50,740 --> 00:00:52,080
(Sheldon:)You don't know that.

16
00:00:52,242 --> 00:00:54,882
(Sheldon:)I still have plenty
of solid leads on this list.

17
00:00:55,045 --> 00:00:56,385
(Leonard:)-Good luck.
-No, wait.

18
00:00:56,546 --> 00:00:59,026
(Sheldon:)I need you to call Stan Lee,
Leonard Nimoy

